  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed ground floor bedroom labelled 'Bedroom Ground Floor Rear', by virtue of its poor outlook, insufficient natural light and lack of privacy would result in substandard and inappropriate form of accommodation incapable of meeting the reasonable needs of occupiers. The proposal is therefore contrary Section 12 of the National Planning Policy (2024), Policies D6 of the London Plan (2021), CP30 of the Enfield Core Strategy (2010), and Polices DMD5 and DMD8 Enfield Development Management Document (2014)."
  ],
